      "id": 10590527127745,
      "title": "Polaroid - Black & White 600 Instant Film",
      "handle": "polaroid-black-white-600-instant-film-prd006003",
      "body_html": "<span>This pack of </span><span>Black &amp; White 600 Instant Film</span><span> from </span><span>Polaroid Originals</span><span> contains eight sheets of film for use with Polaroid 600-series cameras. Producing monochrome images with a long tonal scale, dark blacks, and bright whites, this ISO 640 film offers a classic instant film look with its glossy 3.1 x 3.1\" image area and traditional white borders. Each shot develops in 5-10 minutes after exposure, and the film should be stored in a cool, refrigerated, but not frozen, place before use. Additionally, even though this film features a built-in a battery to power 600-series cameras, it can also be used with i-Type cameras that feature their own camera battery.</span><br><br><br><strong><strong><strong><strong>PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS</strong><br></strong></strong></strong><ul>\n<li>8 Exposures per pack</li>\n<li>Format: 3.5 x 4.2 in. (8.8 x 10.7 cm), Image Area: 3.1 x 3.1 in. (7.9 x 7.9 cm)</li>\n<li>ISO  640</li>\n<li>Classic white frame</li>\n<li>Development: 10-15 minutes approximately at 70°F (21°C)</li>\n<li>Battery: Built in, long lasting battery to power up the camera and flash</li>\n</ul><strong><strong><br><br></strong></strong><p><strong>This film is compatible with the following camera models:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>600 Cameras</li>\n<li>i-Type cameras</li>\n</ul>",
