    {
      "id": 10590357782721,
      "title": "Polaroid - Go Starter Set",
      "handle": "polaroid-go-starter-set-prd006036",
      "body_html": "<span><span>Create big, smaller, with the new Polaroid Go camera and film. The tiniest new member of the Polaroid family is your portable, wearable, partner in creativity. With classic Polaroid film, but much smaller—cute, huh?<br><br><strong><br><br><br>Main Features:</strong></span></span><ul>\n<li>Analog Instant Camera</li>\n<li>Pocket-Sized</li>\n<li>Double Exposure Function</li>\n<li>Portable, wearable, and take-anywhere-able. The Polaroid Go camera is your new partner in creativity.</li>\n<li>Double exposure, half the size:</li>\n<li>Add another layer to your creative vision with easy-to-use double exposure.</li>\n<li>Find your light with the reflective selfie mirror, and pick your pose with plenty of time, thanks to the self-timer</li>\n</ul><span> </span>",
