    {
      "id": 10590357618881,
      "title": "Polaroid Now I-Type Instant Film Camera (Black)",
      "handle": "polaroid-now-i-type-instant-film-camera-black-prd009028",
      "body_html": "<span>Point, shoot, and keep: it’s that simple with the Polaroid Now. This series is an evolution of the original Polaroid OneStep cameras from the ‘70s that made photography effortless for everyone. The Now takes that simplicity and adds greater creative control, clean design, and vibrant color to make it more than a moment maker — but a life accessory.</span><br><br><p><strong><br>Main Featuers: </strong></p><ul class=\"top-section-list\" data-selenium=\"highlightList\">\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Accepts i-Type and 600 Instant Film</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Optical Grade Polycarbonate and Acrylic Lense Coated</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Autofocus system via 2 fixed focus zones: 0.55-1.3m / 0.6m-infinity</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Focal Lenght: 94.96mm (Close-Up) / 102.35mm (Distance)</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Built-In Flash</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Self-Timer Function</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Integrated Double Exposure Mode</li>\n<li class=\"top-section-list-item\">Built-In Lithium-Ion Battery Pack</li>\n</ul><br><br><p><strong>Compatible Film:</strong></p><ul><li>Polaroid and Impossible i-Type and 600-type film in both Color and Black &amp; White, including Special Editions </li></ul>",
      "published_at": "2024-10-17T17:34:49-04:00",
